  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="23.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 23.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit ðonne abbod sie oððe abbodesse, dælen on ða ilcan wisan wið þone kyning.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, [his previous host] is an abbot or abbess, let the division be the same as for the king.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, the person [under whose protection he has been] is an abbot or an abbess, he [or she] shall share [the wergeld] with the king in the same proportion [as the magnate does].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit ðonne abbud sy oððe abbudisse, dælen on ða ilcan wisan wið ðone cyning.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
